---
import UnionProfiles from '../../components/UnionProfiles.astro';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { t } from '../../i18n';
---

<Base title={`${t('en', 'nav.unions')}: profiles · ${t('en', 'site.name')}`} lang="en">
  <article>
    <h1>Union and local profiles</h1>
    <p><strong>Every union in our directory, grouped by sector. Intake links are shown only when verified.</strong></p>
    <h2>What this means for you</h2>
    <p>This page is generated from the union directory. Each profile shows who they organize and a recent win as proof they're actively organizing. Where we haven't verified an intake link, we say so and route you through EWOC or the AFL-CIO instead — we don't guess.</p>
    <UnionProfiles locale="en" />
    <h2>Watch out</h2>
    <p>Directory data comes from union websites and Labor Dept. filings, checked 2026-10-26. Unions change their intake pages; if a link is dead, <a href="/about/corrections">tell us</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>